LAILA KA LAAL RAN MAY TADAPTA HAI QAAK PAR<br>
<br>
1. LAILA KA LAAL RAN MAY TADAPTA HAI QAAK PAR <br>
 AAWAAZ DETAY JAATAY HAIN SARWAR IDHAR UDHAR<br>
<br>
2. ANGDAYI LEKAY AKBAR E MEHROO BHI CHAL BASAY <br>
 HICHKI JO AAYI MOUT KI BABA KE HAATH PAR<br>
<br>
3. THI JAB ZAEEF HATOUN PE KADYAL JAWAAN KI LAASH <br>
 QUDD AMBIYA BHI ROOPADAY MANZAR YE DEKH KAR<br>
<br>
4. UTTHA NA JO HUSSAIN SE LAASHA JAWAN KA <br>
 KHAIMO MAY USKO LEGAYE BACHAY SAMBHAL KAR<br>
<br>
5. KYA DAAG MAA KO DEGAYE ATHTHARA SAAL MAY <br>
 LAILA FUGHAN YE KARTI HAI SAR APNA PEET KAR<br>
<br>
6. WA AKBARA KA SHOOR THA QAIMO MAY CHAAR SOO <br>
 QUDD KO GIRADIYA JUNHII ZAINAB NE LAASH PAR<br>
<br>
7. DIL MAY JO TERE BIYAAH KA ARMAA THA REH GAYA <br>
 ZAINAB BAYAN YE KARTI THI AKBAR KI LAASH PAR<br>
<br>
8. AALAM AJAB THA SYED E SAJJAD KA SOHAIL <br>
 NOK E SINA PE DEKHAR KADYAL JAWAN KA SAR<br>
<br>
 AZZ: RAZA ALI SOHAIL